{0011}{0014}{0010}{0010}A thousand years ago, the Root
Kingdom, a small land in Izumo,
plotted to conquer this Jipang.{0011}{00D0}

{000C}{0011}{0008}{0010}{0010}With that power, in just a few days
they turned Jipang into hell and
claimed it as their own.{0011}{00B9}

{000C}{0010}{0010}Yet only the people of the Fire Clan
resisted the Root Clan stubbornly
and fought to the very end.{0011}{00D6}

{000C}{0010}{0010}The battle lasted for thousands of days.
Most of the Fire Clan lost their lives.
Their capital city was also lost.{0011}{00E7}

{000C}{0010}{0010}The Fire Clan put all their last
strength into seven Holy Swords and
seven young Heroes of Fire.{0011}{00BB}

{000C}{0011}{000A}{0010}{0010}In exchange for their seven lives,
the youths cut down the seven Dark
Orchids and sealed Yomi away.{0011}{00DB}

{000C}{0010}{0010}Over a thousand years, the few
surviving Fire Clan passed their
blood to the people and vanished.{0011}{00FF}

